() Tj T*
(Document ID: SOP-INSP-001) Tj T*
(Version: 1.0) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Inspection Frequency) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Routine inspection of rotating equipment must be conducted daily.) Tj T*
(Comprehensive inspection must be conducted monthly.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Inspection Checklist) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(For each equipment unit record:) Tj T*
(  - Temperature \(ambient and bearing\)) Tj T*
(  - Vibration levels) Tj T*
(  - Lubrication condition) Tj T*
(  - Visual inspection for leaks) Tj T*
(  - Noise and operational anomalies) Tj T*
