<< /Length 500 >>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 750 Td (3. Reporting Requirements) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(All findings must be documented in the inspection report.) Tj T*
(Critical findings must be escalated to the maintenance team within 2 hours.) Tj T*
(Non-critical findings must be logged within 24 hours.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Severity Classification) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(High   - Immediate shutdown required.) Tj T*
(Medium - Schedule repair within 48 hours.) Tj T*
(Low    - Monitor and log; schedule at next maintenance window.) Tj T*
ET
